s:491:"In addition to the built-in SCSS snippets which are officially maintained by the Boost Union team, there is the <a href="https://github.com/moodle-an-hochschulen/moodle-theme_boost_union_snippets" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">SCSS snippets repository on Github</a> which is meant as a community hub for Boost Union SCSS snippets. Please find the instructions for using community SCSS snippets as well as the boilerplate to create your own local SCSS snippets in that repository.";